    "title": "ED-LINKS year-two commences",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Year two activities of the ED-LINKS project commenced at AKU-IED with a Certificate in Education: Educational Leadership and Management programme for 80 head teachers on April 20, 2009.",
